sequenceDiagram
    participant EU as EU Sanctions List
    participant ZfS as Central Office (ZfS)
    participant Listed as Listed Person
    participant Reg as Registers
    participant StA as Prosecutor

    EU->>ZfS: Person/entity listed
    ZfS->>Listed: Reporting obligation (under penalty)
    Listed->>ZfS: Asset disclosure
    ZfS->>Reg: Query banks, land registry, etc.
    ZfS->>ZfS: Administrative investigation
    alt Assets found
        ZfS->>ZfS: Freeze assets
        ZfS->>ZfS: Register in sanctions asset register
    end
    alt Violation suspected
        ZfS->>StA: Refer for criminal prosecution
    end